    {
      "id": "2p2z",
      "label": "2p2z",
      "about": "The Bode window's default design: crossover 1.5 kHz, two zeros at 500 Hz, below the LC resonance at 690 Hz, pole at 30 kHz, matched to z. Phase margin 45° at 1 A and 41° at 2 A, gain margin 17 dB at 1 A and 13 dB at 2 A. The right-half-plane zero (14 kHz at 1 A, 7 kHz at 2 A) keeps the crossover low.",
